    "First Four (#265), pinned for both ports: FirstFour / FirstFourScene /",
    "FirstFourProgress in ios/Sources/MorseKit/FirstFour.swift and",
    "android/app/src/main/java/app/anothermorsetrainer/morsekit/FirstFour.kt.",
    "Read by ios/Sources/MorseKitCheck/main.swift and",
