  "derivation": {
    "rules": [
      "Stages, in order: the four element stages (call, state, question, seventyThree), then the three scenes (bustedCall, noReply, walkthrough).",
      "Element text: call -> the learner's call; state -> the learner's state; question -> '?'; seventyThree -> '73'. Scenes have none.",
      "An element stage has a copy phase then a send phase. A correct answer adds one to the streak, a miss sets it to 0; the streak also starts again at 0 whenever the stage or phase differs from the last answer's. Reaching copyStreakToPass (copy) or sendStreakToPass (send) completes the phase and sets the streak back to 0. Completing copy marks copyPassed; completing send marks the stage passed.",
      "A scene run is clean when it had no mistakes. Clean runs are counted per scene; the scene passes at bustedRoundsToPass / noReplyScenesToPass / walkthroughRunsToPass clean runs. A run with a mistake counts for nothing. noReply plays scene A while it has 0 clean runs and scene B after.",
      "nextStage is the first stage, in order, that has not passed; null when all have.",
      "normalizeCall / normalizeState: upper-case and remove every whitespace character; nothing else is removed.",
      "Valid call: 3-10 characters, only A-Z 0-9 and '/', at least one letter and one digit. Valid state: 2-3 characters, only A-Z.",
      "prefillCall: the normalised saved call, or '' when that is the settings default W1AW or empty.",
      "compact(s) = upper-case s with every whitespace character removed.",
      "Copy matches when compact(typed) == compact(expected) and it is not empty.",
      "Send matches when compact(sent) is not empty and equals compact(expected) or compact(expected) twice over.",
      "partials(call): '?' first, then call[0..<k] + '?' for k = 2 ... length-1, skipping any prefix that ends in '/'. partial(call, round) = partials[round mod count].",
      "activator(index, excluding call): the activator table without any row whose call equals the normalised learner's call, then row index mod its count. otherHunter(index, excluding call) likewise over the other-hunter table.",
      "Scene responses: continued, sent(text), copied(text), waited. hear/silence beats advance on 'continued', else notYourTurn. send beats advance on a matching 'sent', a non-matching 'sent' is sentWrong, anything else is yourTurn. copy beats advance on a matching 'copied' against the beat's answer, anything else is copyWrong. wait beats advance on 'waited', anything else is stayQuiet. A wrong response adds a mistake and stays on the beat; the scene is finished once its last beat has advanced, and responses after that change nothing and answer 'finished'."
    ],
    "defaultCall": "W1AW"
  },
  "stages": ["call", "state", "question", "seventyThree", "bustedCall", "noReply", "walkthrough"],
  "elementStages": ["call", "state", "question", "seventyThree"],
